flowchart LR
  REC[recommendation + expected distribution] --> APP[human approval] --> EXE[execution] --> OUT[outcome]
  OUT --> ERR[error attribution]
  ERR --> CALB[candidate calibration]
  CALB --> GATE{promotion gate}
  GATE -->|better on held-out| ACT[ACTIVE params]
  GATE -->|no| REJ[rejected]
  ACT --> REC
  ACT -. drift monitor .-> ROLL[rollback]
